    "reason": "For updaterequests.kyverno.io between 1.12.6 and 1.13.0, the rendered diffs show spec.versions[name=v1beta1].storage changing from true to false [ev-cf5b10ff8047] and spec.versions[name=v2].storage changing from false to true [ev-d3850c78b94e]. The CRD validator confirms that kyverno.io/v1beta1 UpdateRequest is still an API version in both releases. So v1beta1 is not removed. It keeps being served but is no longer the storage version, which is a change in behaviour, not a removal or a changed value. That makes the subject gvk kyverno.io/v1beta1 UpdateRequest with type behavior-changed and no before/after literals a correct mapping.",
